---
---

<section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0E0E10] via-[#14141A] to-[#0E0E10] border-t border-zinc-900 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Store Image with neon glow border -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 relative group">
        <!-- Amber Backlight -->
        <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFB800] to-[#F59E0B] rounded-3xl blur-xl opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-60 transition duration-500"></div>

        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-[rgba(255,184,0,0.3)] shadow-2xl bg-[#0E0E10]">
          <img
            src="/images/kutuda-makarna-sube-konsepti.jpg"
            alt="Kutuda Makarna Gece Aydınlatmalı Şube Konsepti ve Kiosk Mimarisi"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover transform group-hover:scale-102 transition duration-700"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            width="1000"
            height="667"
          />

          <!-- Overlay Badge -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 bg-[#0E0E10]/85 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#FFB800]/30 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Otantik Şube Atmosferi</div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-[#FFB800] font-medium">Sıcak Ahşap & Neon Aydınlatma</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/subeler"
              class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-[#FFB800] text-[#0E0E10] text-xs font-bold hover:bg-[#F59E0B] transition-colors"
            >
              Şubeleri Gez →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text Pitch -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#FFB800]/10 border border-[#FFB800]/30 text-[#FFB800] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span>✨ Modern Fast-Casual Konsept</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight font-sans leading-tight">
          "HAYAT KISA, <br />
          <span class="text-[#FFB800]">MAKARNA İYİ GELİR!"</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-zinc-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Samsun sokaklarında yükselen taze fesleğen ve tereyağı kokusu tesadüf değil. Kutuda Makarna şubeleri, modern ahşap çıtaları, sıcak amber aydınlatması ve açık mutfak canlı pişirme konseptiyle tasarlandı.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-300">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#FFB800]/20 text-[#FFB800] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Açık Mutfak:</strong> Siparişiniz gözünüzün önünde 3 dakikada tavada bağlanır.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#FFB800]/20 text-[#FFB800] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
            <span><strong>İster Masada, İster Yolda:</strong> Konforlu teras oturma alanı veya pratik gel-al.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#FFB800]/20 text-[#FFB800] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Gece Lezzeti:</strong> Hafta sonu gece 01:00'e kadar açık sıcak servis.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="/hakkimizda"
            class="text-[#FFB800] hover:text-[#F59E0B] font-bold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2 group"
          >
            <span>Kutuda Makarna Hikayesini Keşfet</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
